      "status": "preserved"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0008:0001",
      "source": "By default, the `frameLength` property doesn’t have a useful value upon creation, so you must set this property before using the buffer.",
      "ko": "You can use this option only with the [`record`](avaudiosession/category-swift.struct/record.md) and [`playAndRecord`](avaudiosession/category-swift.struct/playandrecord.md) categories.",
      "sourceHash": "fe773884cd1c19506831ef92bf175b915eed78377b8c105ce8dde960ccce97d2",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0008:0002",
      "source": "The length must be less than or equal to the [`frameCapacity`](avaudiopcmbuffer/framecapacity.md) of the buffer.",
      "ko": "`frameLength` 길이는 버퍼의 [`frameCapacity`](avaudiopcmbuffer/framecapacity.md)보다 작거나 같아야 합니다.",
      "sourceHash": "badad3ee41b75457b361db1b4263c5e95b29fbc7a99aeba490e221e5c0a6b059",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0008:0003",
      "source": "For deinterleaved formats, [`frameCapacity`](avaudiopcmbuffer/framecapacity.md) refers to the size of one channel’s worth of audio samples.",
      "ko": "비인터리브 형식의 경우 [`frameCapacity`](avaudiopcmbuffer/framecapacity.md)는 한 채널의 오디오 샘플 수를 나타냅니다.",
      "sourceHash": "556e4f71df11174e9eb04ef02c5a60ac6a3190842a3854c1b4bbe03d7be868ed",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0009:0001",
      "source": "You may modify the length of the buffer as part of an operation that modifies its contents.",
      "ko": "버퍼 내용을 수정하는 작업의 일부로 버퍼의 길이를 수정할 수 있습니다.",
      "sourceHash": "c1a07f3d2f7ac1359f50007748963852a7c01ef6c52d8edf25fb43214b59016d",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0009:0002",
      "source": "Modifying `frameLength` updates the `mDataByteSize` field in each of the underlying [`AudioBufferList`](https://developer.apple.com/documentation/CoreAudioTypes/AudioBufferList) structure’s `AudioBuffer` properties correspondingly, and vice versa.",
      "ko": "`frameLength`를 수정하면 기본 [`AudioBufferList`](https://developer.apple.com/documentation/CoreAudioTypes/AudioBufferList) 구조의 각 `AudioBuffer` 속성에서 대응하는 `mDataByteSize` 필드가 갱신되며 그 반대도 마찬가지입니다.",
      "sourceHash": "6527e57045abf45466b20900d0b0a394e79aad50cb7d91f7c84ba3a1313f4ec0",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
